WEBVTT

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:18.710
Oh, dear...

00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:20.460
Where's BB?

00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:22.580
I suppose he escaped.

00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:24.000
Princess?

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:31.550
Wait... Is that...

00:00:48.590 --> 00:00:50.150
Find him.

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:53.660
Even if you only bring back his tattoo, 
verify whether he is alive or dead.

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:54.870
Yes, ma'am.

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:10.300
Just wait, Arya.

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:13.940
I'm going to wipe out your ambition, 
and all tattoos along with it.

00:01:17.370 --> 00:01:20.280
In the end, I remained a weakling.

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:22.850
But I kept the hope alive to this point.

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:27.650
Would you accept this, Seigi?

00:01:29.650 --> 00:01:32.740
It's no use. I can't handle it.

00:01:33.270 --> 00:01:36.390
If you couldn't pull it off, 
there's no way I can.

00:01:36.690 --> 00:01:38.270
I'm powerless.

00:01:39.150 --> 00:01:42.080
I couldn't even protect Touko.

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:47.790
At first, it was just Izzy's hope,

00:01:48.320 --> 00:01:51.220
but now, I've taken on 
Kujuli's and Varma's, too,

00:01:51.990 --> 00:01:54.970
and even that old man's.

00:01:55.710 --> 00:01:57.760
I can't carry it all alone anymore.

00:01:58.460 --> 00:02:01.830
If you'll help me, I can still fight.

00:02:02.240 --> 00:02:03.730
Together, with you.

00:02:04.520 --> 00:02:06.540
You're already dead!

00:02:06.540 --> 00:02:08.590
You were swallowed up by me, and died!

00:02:08.590 --> 00:02:10.230
Why would you go that far?!

00:02:12.860 --> 00:02:15.700
The future lies in a place you 
can reach with your hand.

00:02:16.330 --> 00:02:19.040
So what reason do I have not to do it?

00:02:20.120 --> 00:02:22.200
With my hand...

00:02:24.530 --> 00:02:27.250
That hand is my future.

00:02:29.880 --> 00:02:33.220
This hand is your future.

00:03:01.260 --> 00:03:02.940
You're so studious...

00:03:07.730 --> 00:03:08.460
You've got a bite.

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:09.370
Yeah.

00:03:11.550 --> 00:03:15.380
It's been almost a year since Wiseman 
ordered us to move to this hideout.

00:03:16.120 --> 00:03:18.840
I know it's what Blood wanted,

00:03:19.240 --> 00:03:21.140
but how do you feel about him?

00:03:21.690 --> 00:03:23.140
What do you mean?

00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:25.750
Wiseman is a scientist through and through.

00:03:25.750 --> 00:03:26.580
No...

00:03:27.130 --> 00:03:29.810
It might be more accurate to 
call him a mad scientist.

00:03:30.420 --> 00:03:33.290
He's a self-serving man who tried to

00:03:33.290 --> 00:03:35.940
sell American tattoos to the 
Kingdom for his own gains.

00:03:36.300 --> 00:03:39.660
To him, tattoos are the 
ideal research subject.

00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:43.160
There's no way he'll allow 
them to be wiped out.

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:46.280
But the princess is Wiseman's enemy.

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:48.620
As long as we share the same 
interests, he's our ally.

00:03:49.390 --> 00:03:51.350
You trust BB, right?

00:03:51.650 --> 00:03:52.880
Well, of course, but...

00:03:53.440 --> 00:03:56.460
Don't worry. I'll handle things in the end.

00:03:57.670 --> 00:03:58.650
My left arm—

00:04:04.100 --> 00:04:05.800
You've gotten taller.

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:07.520
Sure I have.

00:04:08.080 --> 00:04:10.020
I can't stay a kid forever.

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:16.760
We have a mock battle tonight, right?

00:04:17.170 --> 00:04:19.860
Better get the maintenance on 
your artificial arm done quick.

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:52.990
Letter of Challenge

00:05:53.240 --> 00:05:56.620
Yes! Slutty pink tentacle 
bondage for the win!

00:05:56.620 --> 00:05:58.630
I can't get enough of this!

00:05:58.630 --> 00:06:01.290
This is totally doujinshi material!

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:01.630
Are all army people like that?

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:04.210
<i>No, not that... Please don't look!</i>

00:06:02.050 --> 00:06:04.760
No, I wouldn't say that...

00:06:04.210 --> 00:06:06.840
<i>Fools! Look away and I'll kill her!</i>

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:08.430
<i>Then I guess we have no choice.</i>

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:12.140
What is this? Lizards?

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:14.680
This one is grasshoppers 
and caterpillars...

00:06:14.970 --> 00:06:15.390
Gross.

00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:18.020
We caught some lively ones on the mountain.

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:21.270
We don't have to be 
self-sufficient, you know.

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:23.020
We can just buy food at the 
foot of the mountain!

00:06:23.270 --> 00:06:25.860
Izzy-kun, you shouldn't be picky.

00:06:25.860 --> 00:06:29.320
That's why your chest isn't 
getting any bigger.

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:32.700
I've told you, my body is...  Hey, listen to—

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:31.910
Here, eat up.

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:35.120
Do that and you'll be a real sexy dynamite!

00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:05.480
Boy, we lost big time.

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:08.400
I didn't expect to be 
beaten that thoroughly.

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:11.030
It's like what you were when 
we first met was a lie.

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:13.700
You really have gotten stronger.

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:14.700
It ended before I got to do anything...

00:07:14.080 --> 00:07:16.290
How did you improve so quickly?

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:19.620
How to move, how to make decisions,

00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:21.540
how to counterattack, what to do next...

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:24.840
I can see it all somehow. That's all.

00:07:30.760 --> 00:07:33.220
My waifu!

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:38.100
Tom? Should I take you to the hospital?

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:40.690
What?

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:44.770
<i>The Kingdom may have found the 
location of your hideout.</i>

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:46.730
<i>Just be on the alert.</i>

00:07:46.730 --> 00:07:48.440
They were already here.

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:51.280
Now that they know where we are, 
there's no point in staying.

00:07:51.490 --> 00:07:52.740
We'll head back to HQ.

00:07:53.360 --> 00:07:55.330
Looks like they came to bring us this.

00:08:01.910 --> 00:08:03.920
I've checked the video letter,

00:08:04.210 --> 00:08:06.710
but I don't want to have 
to show it to you...

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:10.510
Why is it necessary to hide it from us?

00:08:10.800 --> 00:08:13.720
The third ruins, in the 
Grand Canyon, is our last fortress.

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:17.060
Even if the princess took the third ruins,

00:08:17.060 --> 00:08:18.850
it wouldn't be the end of everything.

00:08:19.180 --> 00:08:21.810
Without Seigi-kun, 
she wouldn't have all the keys.

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:23.560
Just show us already.

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:31.570
<i>So as you can see, I am now</i>

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:33.820
<i>vacationing at a private California beach.</i>

00:08:34.200 --> 00:08:37.240
<i>It's been a year, boy. Have you been well?</i>

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:39.080
<i>It's nice here.</i>

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:42.660
<i>A beach open to the public 
is like a hog farm.</i>

00:08:42.660 --> 00:08:44.120
<i>The ocean is full of lard.</i>

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:48.540
<i>Everything in this country is so 
needlessly huge. So needlessly.</i>

00:08:49.210 --> 00:08:50.800
Not a very nice atmosphere...

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:54.050
<i>I'm thinking of stopping by the Grand Canyon next</i>

00:08:54.050 --> 00:08:57.140
<i>for some archaeological research.</i>

00:08:57.140 --> 00:09:00.060
<i>Why don't you come and help me, boy?</i>

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:02.890
<i>If you feel up to it, let's meet up there.</i>

00:09:02.890 --> 00:09:03.980
<i>Whoops...</i>

00:09:03.980 --> 00:09:05.940
No way! Lisa's alive?

00:09:05.940 --> 00:09:07.230
<i>Hey, now.</i>

00:09:07.230 --> 00:09:10.110
<i>You need to keep that camera still.</i>

00:09:10.650 --> 00:09:14.650
<i>In any case, the swimsuit I bought 
last year is already a bit tight.</i>

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:15.660
<i>A cue card.</i>

00:09:15.660 --> 00:09:16.910
<i>I just saw a cue card.</i>

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:20.870
<i>Hey... I-Il! What on earth are you wearing?</i>

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:24.370
<i>It's my swimsuit. 
The princess chose it for me.</i>

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:27.790
<i>And on that note... Melon love!</i>

00:09:28.580 --> 00:09:31.380
Looove!

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:31.590
What... was that at the end?

00:09:32.340 --> 00:09:33.550
That's it.

00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:35.170
Izzy, you're going, right?

00:09:35.170 --> 00:09:37.930
You'd better believe it. 
I'm going to save Lisa.

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:39.850
You're not going.

00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:42.640
What are you saying, Wiseman?

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:44.480
What else can we do if we don't fight now?

00:09:45.020 --> 00:09:48.020
I've had you grow stronger 
over this past year

00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:50.230
so that you would survive 
to the final moment.

00:09:50.690 --> 00:09:52.440
Not to beat the princess.

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:53.650
What kind of bull is that?

00:09:54.030 --> 00:09:55.530
I can tell you now that your time to act

00:09:55.820 --> 00:09:59.570
will be when the princess 
activates the ruins.

00:09:59.950 --> 00:10:02.790
I'll plant a virus in your 
tattoo, which is the key,

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:04.830
and use it to destroy the ruins system.

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:07.750
Since the virus isn't yet complete,

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:09.460
I can't have you dying on me.

00:10:09.710 --> 00:10:11.670
So you want me to keep 
running away until then?

00:10:11.960 --> 00:10:12.800
That's right.

00:10:14.550 --> 00:10:18.260
The princess, born for the sake of the 
tattoos, uses the atmosphere as a trigger

00:10:18.680 --> 00:10:20.890
to freely control her sisters' powers,

00:10:20.890 --> 00:10:23.890
making her the strongest Sealed of all.

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:28.310
If I have the power that confined 
my ability, I can win.

00:10:28.310 --> 00:10:30.900
If not that, then if I have 
Tom-san's noise canceler...

00:10:31.230 --> 00:10:32.650
It won't work.

00:10:33.940 --> 00:10:37.400
The power to seal tattoos, an ability 
unique to the triggerless tattoo,

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:40.530
ceases all phenomena that 
originate from a tattoo.

00:10:40.530 --> 00:10:42.870
The noise canceler is no exception.

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:46.250
If the princess can use it, 
can't I learn to use it, too?

00:10:46.540 --> 00:10:48.370
We don't have that kind of time.

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:52.590
I wanted you to accept your weakness,

00:10:53.090 --> 00:10:55.170
and our limited number of options.

00:10:56.340 --> 00:10:58.880
I'm fairly sure BB would have accepted it.

00:11:00.300 --> 00:11:03.300
No, Blood would have said,

00:11:03.720 --> 00:11:06.810
"We have to at least get Lisa back."

00:11:08.310 --> 00:11:11.650
Wiseman, make the arrangements 
to get us to America at once.

00:11:12.520 --> 00:11:13.150
Izzy...

00:11:13.520 --> 00:11:16.780
I'll bring Seigi back alive, 
even if it costs my own life.

00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:20.200
I'll offer my own life, too.

00:11:20.530 --> 00:11:21.530
So will I.

00:11:22.780 --> 00:11:26.370
<i>Seigi is a prisoner to his craving 
for revenge against the princess.</i>

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:29.620
<i>Even if it's a given that we'll lose,</i>

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:33.080
<i>we can never move forward if we keep 
avoiding a showdown with her.</i>

00:11:33.880 --> 00:11:37.670
<i>Blood, I'll set Seigi on the right path.</i>

00:11:38.460 --> 00:11:39.720
<i>Just like you want,</i>

00:11:40.340 --> 00:11:41.970
<i>I'm coming to see you, Arya.</i>

00:11:42.800 --> 00:11:43.930
<i>Because that's...</i>

00:11:43.930 --> 00:11:48.180
<i>That's the only reason you killed Touko.</i>

00:11:49.060 --> 00:11:51.480
I will be the one to kill you.

00:11:58.690 --> 00:12:00.240
Mission complete.

00:12:01.650 --> 00:12:04.910
Now, I wonder how Tamaki-san is doing...

00:12:07.870 --> 00:12:08.490
Yumi.

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:10.710
Tama-chan!

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:13.080
You really came!

00:12:13.080 --> 00:12:16.250
Yeah. I'm going to be leaving 
Japan for a while,

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:19.590
so I wanted to see your 
cute face before I left.

00:12:19.840 --> 00:12:21.720
Oh, there you go again!

00:12:22.090 --> 00:12:24.340
Isn't that paper bag full of 
the loot you've bought today?

00:12:24.590 --> 00:12:26.300
Figured me out, huh?

00:12:26.300 --> 00:12:27.850
As if you'd ever come to one of

00:12:27.850 --> 00:12:30.470
these events and leave empty-handed.

00:12:31.350 --> 00:12:35.310
There's something I want to 
say to you before I leave.

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:37.110
Tama-chan?

00:12:38.730 --> 00:12:41.530
Yumi, if I make it back alive,

00:12:42.070 --> 00:12:43.360
I want you to marry me.

00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:45.240
You...

00:12:46.410 --> 00:12:49.080
Wait, no, Tama-chan! 
Isn't a line like that a death flag?!

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:52.120
I'm the protagonist in your story.

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:54.330
So I'll come back alive for sure.

00:12:54.710 --> 00:12:55.370
Stop!

00:12:55.710 --> 00:12:58.290
You are the protagonist in my story,

00:12:58.290 --> 00:13:00.380
but in this world, you're just 
a background character!

00:13:01.260 --> 00:13:02.130
It'll be fine.

00:13:02.920 --> 00:13:04.880
We were childhood friends,

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:06.970
then we overcame a sad parting,

00:13:07.680 --> 00:13:09.810
and had a fateful reunion

00:13:09.810 --> 00:13:12.270
in the middle of that crowd of human trash!

00:13:12.890 --> 00:13:13.890
Tama-chan...

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:15.350
I'll leave this with you.

00:13:16.270 --> 00:13:17.480
I haven't read it yet.

00:13:17.480 --> 00:13:22.400
I Got Started in Tentacles

00:13:17.730 --> 00:13:18.610
This is...

00:13:18.940 --> 00:13:22.400
the latest book from the super popular circle 
with the booth right by the door, Araibudou!

00:13:23.440 --> 00:13:25.700
I'll look forward to reading 
it when I get back.

00:13:26.030 --> 00:13:28.120
I'll hop over there, take care 
of business, and rush back.

00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:31.370
Tama-chan! How many flags 
are you trying to raise?!

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:33.700
There's no way you'll be 
able to break this many!

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:36.170
<i>Yikes... Those people are messed up.</i>

00:13:42.960 --> 00:13:44.720
Tamaki-san, who's that?

00:13:45.130 --> 00:13:46.970
The cosplayer I'm engaged to.

00:13:47.300 --> 00:13:48.680
We're getting married when I get home.

00:13:50.220 --> 00:13:50.810
Huh?

00:13:51.390 --> 00:13:52.770
<i>Y-You're kidding me!</i>

00:13:52.770 --> 00:13:55.180
<i>Tamaki-san was secretly a 
normie with a love life?!</i>

00:14:03.480 --> 00:14:04.530
Looks perfect.

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:07.110
The only thing that could get through

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:09.070
that tight security would be a bee.

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:10.870
Good work, Sanders-kun.

00:14:11.160 --> 00:14:12.030
Report!

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:15.370
Intruder located at point D-3! 
Inquiry requested!

00:14:15.370 --> 00:14:15.790
What?!

00:14:16.040 --> 00:14:17.080
Put the video up!

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:19.000
Enlarging.

00:14:20.670 --> 00:14:21.460
So they're here.

00:14:21.710 --> 00:14:24.090
I'll pay them back here for the 
humiliation we suffered in Japan.

00:14:24.090 --> 00:14:28.050
I'm gonna shove a red-hot 
German Shepherd up his ass.

00:14:29.890 --> 00:14:33.260
This will be the end of my role.

00:14:33.260 --> 00:14:36.640
Just as life sprang from inanimate objects,

00:14:36.640 --> 00:14:39.650
order is born from chaos.

00:14:39.650 --> 00:14:41.860
I will become the avatar of chaos

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:44.480
and offer up my life to the Creator!

00:14:44.780 --> 00:14:47.820
Princess! Create a new order

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:50.610
from the earth to which I return!

00:14:53.660 --> 00:14:54.910
That monster!

00:14:55.080 --> 00:14:56.830
Fire a barrage at him!

00:14:57.160 --> 00:14:58.910
More enemies will show up.

00:14:58.910 --> 00:15:01.000
Call for backup from the nearby bases!

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:04.550
Pull back the defense line and 
tighten security around the ruins!

00:15:04.550 --> 00:15:06.800
Let down your guard and you're dead meat!

00:15:14.890 --> 00:15:16.600
Looks like it's already started.

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:18.060
Let's hurry.

00:15:19.390 --> 00:15:20.350
Stop!

00:15:22.350 --> 00:15:25.780
We're supposed to be allies 
of the US Army...

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:28.240
They can't tell the difference 
from where they are.

00:15:28.530 --> 00:15:30.910
Then we'll have to cut across from here.

00:15:32.570 --> 00:15:33.620
Which means...

00:15:33.820 --> 00:15:35.240
they'll just have to clear a path for us!

00:15:39.620 --> 00:15:41.250
I'm totally your backup!

00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:45.960
<i>If you don't wanna die, stay down.</i>

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:53.760
You've got a pretty nice squeal, for a pig.

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:56.220
Kill me... Please kill me...

00:15:57.720 --> 00:16:01.350
Lakha, it's been a while 
since I teamed up with you.

00:16:03.350 --> 00:16:06.020
Get smaller, get smaller...

00:16:08.110 --> 00:16:09.570
That tickles.

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:15.570
Seigi, stay calm.

00:16:15.950 --> 00:16:17.160
You don't have to tell me!

00:16:19.870 --> 00:16:21.870
Those soldiers were the tattoo force...

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:24.040
Izzy's war buddies.

00:16:25.630 --> 00:16:26.840
The princess isn't here.

00:16:27.710 --> 00:16:29.340
Could this be a diversion, too?

00:16:29.760 --> 00:16:33.340
Seigi-kun, head toward the ruins with Tom.

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:36.600
We'll beat these guys and 
catch up with you soon.

00:16:37.180 --> 00:16:38.220
Tamaki...

00:16:38.930 --> 00:16:41.560
It'll be trouble if the princess 
joins up with them here.

00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:43.980
The army's defense will eventually fall.

00:16:44.310 --> 00:16:45.100
In which case...

00:16:45.650 --> 00:16:46.610
You're right.

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:49.190
Okay. Then...

00:16:49.400 --> 00:16:51.570
Izzy, Tama-san, see you at the ruins!

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:01.660
Lisa...

00:17:14.930 --> 00:17:17.970
Isn't backup here yet?! 
We can't hold out on our own!

00:17:14.930 --> 00:17:17.970
Bravo 2-3! Bravo 2-3! This is Tango Alpha!

00:17:18.350 --> 00:17:18.680
Hey!

00:17:26.310 --> 00:17:27.730
Who are you?!

00:17:27.730 --> 00:17:30.320
Hey, now. Is that what you say 
to the guy who saved you?

00:17:31.030 --> 00:17:32.820
You guys are getting your asses kicked.

00:17:33.150 --> 00:17:34.820
Don't you have any original Sealed?

00:17:35.030 --> 00:17:36.910
They're heading this way right now!

00:17:37.360 --> 00:17:39.740
I see. Guess you can't help it, then.

00:17:40.030 --> 00:17:41.540
Stay back.

00:17:41.740 --> 00:17:44.370
Huh? Who do you think you are? And wh—

00:17:51.090 --> 00:17:52.250
Those needles...

00:17:53.010 --> 00:17:55.510
Are you the one who attacked our hideout?

00:17:55.760 --> 00:17:57.220
Oh, right.

00:17:57.220 --> 00:17:59.350
You're a friend of that kid's.

00:18:05.140 --> 00:18:07.900
Given my position, I can't 
tell you my real name,

00:18:08.230 --> 00:18:10.230
but you can call me Tamaki.

00:18:13.610 --> 00:18:15.690
Since I owe you such a huge debt,

00:18:16.070 --> 00:18:17.910
I'm going to make you hurt a little bit.

00:18:18.110 --> 00:18:20.660
Hey! Sorry to keep you guys waiting.

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:23.910
You can leave the rest to the 
Awful Shark, Dean Carter—

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:27.710
That's what happens when 
you let your guard down.

00:18:28.290 --> 00:18:31.420
Unlike Lakha, the thought of leaving

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:34.210
this battlefield alive 
hasn't crossed my mind.

00:18:34.460 --> 00:18:35.590
But that's my preference.

00:18:36.260 --> 00:18:38.930
I want to feel the terror of dying.

00:18:39.220 --> 00:18:42.470
For that, I need someone to risk 
their life to knock me down.

00:18:42.760 --> 00:18:45.350
That's why I'm teaching those guys

00:18:45.350 --> 00:18:46.980
that it's kill or be killed.

00:18:47.600 --> 00:18:50.350
Come on, make me dance 
on the edge of death!

00:18:50.940 --> 00:18:54.860
If I can do that, I wouldn't 
mind giving you my life.

00:18:55.070 --> 00:18:56.820
Okay, I see.

00:18:57.190 --> 00:18:59.490
This is one death that I 
can say was not in vain.

00:19:02.030 --> 00:19:04.910
Haven't seen you in a while, little bunny.

00:19:04.910 --> 00:19:07.040
I've found out some things since last time.

00:19:07.290 --> 00:19:10.870
Bluesy Fruesy, former US Army lieutenant,

00:19:10.870 --> 00:19:12.630
and the army's first Sealed.

00:19:13.290 --> 00:19:15.880
Long ago, a pair of married geologists

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:18.260
brought their two kids here.

00:19:18.630 --> 00:19:20.550
By pure chance, it happened to be a ruins,

00:19:20.550 --> 00:19:22.550
and sadly, the triggerless tattoo

00:19:22.550 --> 00:19:24.970
spontaneously went off in the 
little brother's hands.

00:19:24.970 --> 00:19:28.020
With one child left, that family 
then disappeared, they say.

00:19:28.350 --> 00:19:30.600
The US Army learned of tattoos

00:19:30.600 --> 00:19:32.860
because of that accident, 
and began their research.

00:19:33.270 --> 00:19:35.520
The daughter who survived the accident

00:19:35.520 --> 00:19:37.610
was taken in by the officer overlooking it.

00:19:37.820 --> 00:19:39.860
Isn't that a nice story?

00:19:39.860 --> 00:19:43.820
A pure little girl, 
forced into service for the

00:19:43.820 --> 00:19:45.780
tattoos that took away her family!

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:48.000
That old man had good sense!

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:51.290
Oh, and I think you know this, 
but the girl in the story

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:53.790
was Schrödinger's Cat, Il.

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:57.090
She had a rough time.

00:19:57.090 --> 00:19:59.880
Even with her possession ability,

00:19:59.880 --> 00:20:02.090
Il couldn't possess Sealed easily.

00:20:02.090 --> 00:20:05.800
So I took on the role of her trainer.

00:20:05.800 --> 00:20:09.640
I had all kinds of good times with her!

00:20:12.730 --> 00:20:14.150
Will you shut up already?

00:20:14.650 --> 00:20:17.570
As usual, there's nothing but 
swill dripping from your mouth.

00:20:17.900 --> 00:20:21.860
Primitive animals both ate and 
defecated with the same orifice.

00:20:21.860 --> 00:20:23.740
Are you like them?

00:20:24.320 --> 00:20:27.080
Let me tell you one thing about me.

00:20:27.280 --> 00:20:31.120
As you can see, just as my 
body's growth has halted,

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:32.830
my mentality is also immature.

00:20:33.170 --> 00:20:36.170
I'm not as good a person as Blood was.

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:39.800
I hope you won't complain 
if I end up killing you.

00:20:40.010 --> 00:20:42.130
I like those eyes...

00:20:42.800 --> 00:20:44.840
My junior is racing straight toward

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:48.010
ecstasy at Mach speed!

00:22:45.010 --> 00:22:45.710
Impossible!

00:22:46.090 --> 00:22:48.930
What's the meaning of this, Sanders-kun? 
How can a single bee—

00:22:58.850 --> 00:23:02.860
Again?! You're getting in my way again?!

00:23:06.030 --> 00:23:06.990
Stop.

00:23:08.860 --> 00:23:10.320
Let him live.

00:23:10.820 --> 00:23:14.370
The show isn't complete without a clown 
at both the beginning and the end.

00:23:14.580 --> 00:23:16.450
The... princess?

00:23:16.830 --> 00:23:19.040
It's been a long time, 
Brigadier General Sanders.

00:23:19.540 --> 00:23:21.830
Forgive me, but I'll be 
taking what you have here.

00:23:24.250 --> 00:23:27.760
This power belongs to America! 
It's America's power!

00:23:27.760 --> 00:23:29.930
I won't let you people

00:23:29.930 --> 00:23:32.220
lay a single finger on it!

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:38.310
A man's misplaced conviction 
is a truly frightening thing.

00:23:41.480 --> 00:23:45.940
I've... made a promise to return home alive.

00:23:47.320 --> 00:23:50.360
For better or for worse, 
it looks like the path is laid.

00:23:51.240 --> 00:23:54.030
Let's go and meet Seigi-kun!

00:23:51.820 --> 00:23:55.030
In the Palm of the Hand
